    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of January 22, 2021\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 18th of January, 2021]\n\nPENAL CODE (AMENDMENT)\n\nACT, No. 5 OF 2021\n\nPenal Code (Amendment) Act, No. 5 of 20211\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 43/2016\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE PENAL CODE ( CHAPTER 19 )\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Penal Code(Amendment) Act, No. 5 of 2021.\n\n2.The word \u201cCeylon\u201d, wherever it appears in the PenalCode (Chapter 19) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) other than in sections 3, 18A, 120, 138, 158,159, 160, 225 and 256A thereof, shall be substituted with theword \u201cSri Lanka\u201d.\n\n3.The word \u201cQueen\u201d, wherever it appears in theprincipal enactment, other than in sections 19, 115 and 120thereof, shall be substituted with the word \u201cRepublic\u201d.\n\n4.Section 12 of the principal enactment is herebyrepealed and the following section is substituted therefor:-\n\n12. The word \u201cRepublic\u201d denotes theDemocratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.\u201d.\n\n5.Section 13 of the principal enactment is herebyrepealed.\n\n6.Section 14 of the principal enactment is herebyrepealed and the following section is substituted therefor:-\n\n14. The word \u201cGovernment\u201d, where noother meaning is indicated by any descriptiveor qualifying words or by the context, and the\n\nShort title\n\nReplacement ofthe word\u201cSri Lanka\u201d forthe word\u201cCeylon\u201d inChapter 19\n\nReplacement ofsection 12 of theprincipalenactment\u201cRepublic\n\nReplacement ofthe word\u201cRepublic\u201d forthe word\u201cQueen\u201d in theprincipalenactment\n\nRepeal ofsection 13 of theprincipalenactmentReplacement ofsection 14 of theprincipalenactment\u201cGovernment"
