    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nECONOMIC SERVICE CHARGE (AMENDMENT) ACT, No. 4 OF 2020\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 12th of October, 2020]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 4.00Postage : Rs. 15.00\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of October 16, 2020\n\nThis Act can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nEconomic Service Charge (Amendment)Act, No. 4 of 20201\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 62/2019\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE ECONOMIC SERVICE CHARGEACT, NO.13 OF 2006\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Economic Service Charge(Amendment) Act, No. 4 of 2020.\n\n2.Section 2 of the Economic Service Charge Act, No.13 of 2006 is hereby amended in subsection (1) by thesubstitution for the words \u201cbe charged from every person andevery partnership for every quarter of every year ofassessment\u201d, of the words and figures \u201cbe charged from everyperson and every partnership for every quarter of every yearof assessment prior to January 1, 2020 \u2014\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendment ofsection 2 of Act,No. 13 of 2006.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in case ofinconsistency.\n\n[Certified on 12th of October, 2020]\n\n2Economic Service Charge (Amendment)Act, No. 4 of 2020\n\nEnglish Acts of the Parliament can be purchased at the \u201cPRAKASHANA PIYASA\u201d, DEPARTMENT OFGOVERNMENT PRINTING, NO. 118, DR. DANISTER DE SILVA MAWATHA, COLOMBO 8."
